<title>UK: Citibank sets call, put warrants on SMI.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets call, put warrants on SMI.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank said it has issued a total of six million American-style call and put warrants, in six equal tranches, on the Swiss Market Index.</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   13.JUN.98		 PAYDATE	22.MAY.97</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  5,141.7 CHF</p>
<p>* * * *</p>
<p> WARRANT	STRIKE     ISSUE	PREMIUM</p>
<p> CALL A	 5,000 CHF  5.15 CHF   7.3 PCT</p>
<p> PUT A	  5,000 CHF  3.18 CHF   9.0 PCT</p>
<p> CALL B	 5,250 CHF  3.95 CHF   9.8 PCT</p>
<p> PUT B	  5,250 CHF  4.43 CHF   6.5 PCT</p>
<p> CALL C	 5,500 CHF  2.90 CHF  12.6 PCT</p>
<p> PUT C	  5,500 CHF  5.88 CHF  4.5 PCT</p>
</text>
